    "/queryPay": {
      "post": {
        "summary": "充值查询接口",
        "deprecated": false,
        "description": "# 充值查询\n\n### 1. 接入网址(请参考下图)\n\n> https://[接入网址]/SH/sendPay\n\n![image.png](https://example.invalid/api/v1/projects/3863922/resources/444665/image-preview)\n\n### 2. 资料传送需经过加密，请参考 `重要信息g.** AES 加解密与请求 (串接前必读) **`\n\n### 3. 充值接口返回\n\n#### （1）返回数据结构\n\n| 字段               | 描述                                                         |\n| ------------------ | ------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| resCode            | 错误代码，000000为成功其余都为失败                           |\n| resDesc            | 成功失败信息                                                 |\n| data               | 回传信息                                                     |\n| data.orderId       | 第三方订单号                                                 |\n| data.shOrderNo     | 商户系统订单号, 该订单号将作为接口的返回数据                 |\n| data.orderType     | 订单充值类型 <br />  |\n| data.status        | 参考 `重要信息d.订单状态`                                    |\n| data.orderAmount   | 商户订单金额                                                 |\n| data.paidAmount    | 用户实际充值金额                                             |\n| data.requestAmount | PayHub产生充值金额                                           |\n| data.createdAt     | 订单创建时间, 格式: `yyyy-MM-dd HH:mm:ss`                    |\n| data.finishedAt    | 订单完成时间, 格式: `yyyy-MM-dd HH:mm:ss`                    |\n\n#### （2）返回示例\n\n```json\n{\n  \"resCode\": \"000000\",\n  \"resDesc\": \"操作成功\",\n  \"data\": {\n    \"shOrderNo\": \"ff91c0c1-3055-4b3b-8014-39d9c75ad8ba\",\n    \"orderAmount\": 11,\n    \"requestAmount\": 11,\n    \"paidAmount\": 11,\n    \"createdAt\": \"2024-04-25 21:32:35\",\n    \"finishedAt\": \"2024-05-04 05:13:09\",\n    \"status\": 3,\n    \"orderType\": \"QRPay\",\n    \"orderId\": \"D-1208251955115456726642689\"\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### 4. 请求实例\n\n#### （1）Body `urlencoded`\n\n| 字段      | 描述                                                         |\n| --------- | ------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| shOrderNo | **string(50)** <br />必填 <br />商户订单号, 该订单号将作为接口的返回数据 `该值需在商户系统内唯一存在` |",
        "operationId": "doQueryPayUsingPOST",
        "tags": [
          "商户交易查询接口",
          "金流测试查询接口"
        ],
        "parameters": [],
        "requestBody": {
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": {
                "type": "object",
                "properties": {
                  "shOrderNo": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "description": "商户订单号, 该订单号将作为接口的返回数据 该值需在商户系统内唯一存在",
                    "maxLength": 50
                  }
                },
                "required": [
                  "shOrderNo",
                  "01HZ6VPRV7BMM6SE24A3TQ7M43"
                ]
              },
              "example": {
                "shOrderNo": "ff91c0c1-3055-4b3b-8014-39d9c75ad8ba"
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "type": "object",
                  "properties": {
                    "resCode": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "description": "响应编码"
                    },
                    "resDesc": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "description": "描述信息"
                    },
                    "data": {
                      "type": "object",
                      "properties": {},
                      "description": "响应结果"
                    }
                  },
                  "required": [
                    "resCode",
                    "resDesc",
                    "data"
                  ]
                },
                "examples": {
                  "1": {
                    "summary": "成功示例",
                    "value": {
                      "resCode": "000000",
                      "resDesc": "操作成功",
                      "data": {
                        "shOrderNo": "ff91c0c1-3055-4b3b-8014-39d9c75ad8ba",
                        "orderAmount": 11,
                        "requestAmount": 11,
                        "paidAmount": 11,
                        "createdAt": "2024-04-25 21:32:35",
                        "finishedAt": "2024-05-04 05:13:09",
                        "status": 3,
                        "orderType": "QRPay",
                        "orderId": "D-1208251955115456726642689"
                      }
                    }
                  },
                  "2": {
                    "summary": "异常示例",
                    "value": {
                      "resCode": "000103",
                      "resDesc": "商户信息不存在",
                      "data": null
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            },
            "headers": {}
          },
          "201": {
            "description": "",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "type": "object",
