    "/SH/sendWithdraw": {
      "post": {
        "summary": "发送代付订单",
        "deprecated": false,
        "description": "## 1.接入网址请参考下图\n\n![image.png](https://example.invalid/api/v1/projects/3863922/resources/444674/image-preview)\n\n## 2.资料传送需经过加密,请参考：重要信息-A-g. AES 加解密与请求 (串接前必读)\n\n## 3.由商户对平台发起请求\n\n\n![代付交易.png](https://example.invalid/api/v1/projects/3863922/resources/469182/image-preview)\n\n## 4. 代付Notification API结果通知\n\n| Key          | Description                                                  |\n| ------------ | ------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| sh_order_no  | **string(50)**<br />required<br />商户订单号, 该订单号将作为接口的返回数据 `该值需在商户系统内唯一存在` |\n| order_status | **string(20)** <br />代付结果<br />请参考`重要信息 e.常见错误类型说明` |\n| order_amount | **decimal(14,6)**<br />商户订单金额                          |\n| paid_amount  | **decimal(14,6)\\|null**<br />实际到账金额                    |\n\n```json\n{\n\t\"order_status\": 3,\n\t\"sh_order_no\": \"20250121084528181009644\",\n\t\"order_amount\": 200000.000000,\n\t\"paid_amount\": 200000.000000\n}\n```",
        "operationId": "sendWithdrawUsingPOST",
        "tags": [
          "代付相关接口"
        ],
        "parameters": [
          {
            "name": "Authorization",
            "in": "header",
            "description": "token",
            "required": false,
            "example": "",
            "schema": {
              "type": "string",
              "default": "Bearer_token"
            }
          }
        ],
        "requestBody": {
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": {
                "type": "object",
                "properties": {
                  "sh_order_no": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "description": "string(50) \n必填 \n商户订单号, 该订单号将作为接口的返回数据 该值需在商户系统内唯一存在",
                    "maxLength": 50
                  },
                  "bank_code": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "description": "string(50)\n必填\n银行代码, 网银支付时提供\n请参考 A-c. 银行代码列表\n请选择商户币种其所属的银行代码，单一商户仅能使用单一币种",
                    "maxLength": 50
                  },
                  "bank_account": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "description": "string(50)\n必填\n银行帐户",
                    "maxLength": 50
                  },
                  "bank_user_name": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "description": "string(50)\n必填\n银行户名\n银行真实姓名（如有需要时对账用）",
                    "maxLength": 50
                  },
                  "order_amount": {
                    "type": "number",
                    "description": "decimal(14,6)\n必填\n商户订单金额\n使用越南银行时应为正整数，不允许含有小数的金额",
                    "format": "double"
                  },
                  "notify_url": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "description": "string(255)\n异步通知商户地址\n若有需要可於 商户後台/交易纪录 中手动操作结果通知",
                    "maxLength": 255
                  },
                  "operate_type": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "description": "string(50)\n必填\n类型:\nAUTO: 自动提现\nHAND: 人工提现",
                    "maxLength": 50
                  },
                  "note": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "description": "string(100)\n备注",
                    "maxLength": 100
                  }
                },
                "required": [
                  "sh_order_no",
                  "bank_code",
                  "bank_account",
                  "bank_user_name",
                  "order_amount",
                  "operate_type"
                ]
              },
              "example": ""
            }
          }
        },
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "type": "object",
                  "properties": {
                    "error_code": {
                      "type": "integer",
                      "description": "订单发起处理状态代码\n若处理成功则回传 200，除此之外皆为处理失败\n应以此状态判断订单请求成功后再做接续处理\n相关状态代码可参考 A-e. 错误代码列表 或 A-f. 常见错误类型说明\n部份錯誤也會觸發充值結果通知，請參考 C-b. 代付结果通知。"
                    },
                    "data": {
                      "type": "object",
                      "properties": {
                        "order_id": {
                          "type": "string",
                          "description": "第三方订单号"
                        },
                        "sh_order_no": {
                          "type": "string",
                          "description": "商户订单号"
                        }
                      },
                      "required": [
                        "order_id",
                        "sh_order_no"
                      ],
                      "description": "\t回传信息"
                    }
                  },
                  "required": [
                    "error_code",
                    "data"
